# MongoDB Atlas Kit

This kit provides ready-to-roll dashboards, queries, alerts, flows, templates, and playbooks.

The MongoDB Atlas Kit is licensed under the BSD 2-Clause and the contents are available on [GitHub](https://github.com/gravwell/kits/tree/main/mongodb-atlas).

There is an [Integration Guide](https://docs.gravwell.io/integrations/application/mongodb-atlas.html) to assist you in quickly onboarding data for The MongoDB Atlas Kit.

## Dependencies
- None

